    "created_at": "2016-08-25T14:18:42Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-08-25T14:18:42Z",
    "body": "To be clear, the change proposed here is a document conformance requirement only (i.e. it doesn't impact UAs or innerText directly). It's mostly about what markup patterns we want to encourage.\n",
