    "created_at": "2016-09-06T08:47:34Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-09-06T08:47:34Z",
    "body": "OK, thanks. We could change both the content model and tweak innerText (as noted in my previous comment).\n\nFor epubcheck it looks like this line would need a change if they want to match up with the spec:\nhttps://github.com/IDPF/epubcheck/blob/989595ba3aaf84a1735d46f248e98eb37944d12d/src/main/resources/com/adobe/epubcheck/schema/30/mod/html5/html5-phrasing-30.rnc#L133\n",
